{"4575400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space Postal Service", "steam_appid": 4575400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wonder how mail gets delivered across the solar system? Well, actually.. its your job! Fly your ship to various planets in this little universe, each with there own simulated gravitational pull and orbit around the sun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is filled with unique characters who need there mail delivered! You should get to know them! Just be sure not to open their mail (you can totally read their mail). Earn money for your deliveries while also collecting unique postage stamps to fill your notebook! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick up mail.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/5a41049307206d77f67893a97ce5a20a.poster.avif?t=1788066238\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/5a41049307206d77f67893a97ce5a20a.webm?t=1788066238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/5a41049307206d77f67893a97ce5a20a.mp4?t=1788066238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate to the address.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/df70657df6224a67e68d54c558729989.poster.avif?t=1788066238\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/df70657df6224a67e68d54c558729989.webm?t=1788066238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/df70657df6224a67e68d54c558729989.mp4?t=1788066238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deliver mail, profit.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/8f14a29a860c3318cb06b6cf4e21da77.poster.avif?t=1788066238\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/8f14a29a860c3318cb06b6cf4e21da77.webm?t=1788066238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/8f14a29a860c3318cb06b6cf4e21da77.mp4?t=1788066238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>hand drawn</strong>, 2.5D universe by <strong>flying from planet to planet</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver mail</strong> to unique places and characters for cash. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Read outgoing mail</strong> and <strong>collect unique postage stamps</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase ship upgrades</strong> from the scrapyard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover unique ship designs</strong> to outfit your ship!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight space pirates</strong> on your delivery routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space walk</strong> with the ship tether to deliver in space!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the inhabitants, they might just have some interesting things to say.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>simulated gravity</strong> and <strong>planetary orbits</strong> as you fly your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk all the way around each world as you explore! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fuel levels or be stranded in space, better call the space tow ship!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is still ongoing, stay tuned for updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wonder how mail gets delivered across the solar system? Well, actually.. its your job! Fly your ship to various planets in this little universe, each with there own simulated gravitational pull and orbit around the sun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is filled with unique characters who need there mail delivered! You should get to know them! Just be sure not to open their mail (you can totally read their mail). Earn money for your deliveries while also collecting unique postage stamps to fill your notebook! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick up mail.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/5a41049307206d77f67893a97ce5a20a.poster.avif?t=1788066238\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/5a41049307206d77f67893a97ce5a20a.webm?t=1788066238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/extras/5a41049307206d77f67893a97ce5a20a.mp4?t=1788066238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate to the address.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 