s</strong> on your delivery routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space walk</strong> with the ship tether to deliver in space!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the inhabitants, they might just have some interesting things to say.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>simulated gravity</strong> and <strong>planetary orbits</strong> as you fly your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk all the way around each world as you explore! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fuel levels or be stranded in space, better call the space tow ship!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is still ongoing, stay tuned for updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Fly from planet to planet delivering mail to the folks who live on these tiny worlds. Get to know them, just be sure not to read the mail. Chill out and fly around this hand drawn, 2.5D simulated solar system, earn money for your deliveries while collecting stamps to fill your notebook.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/8c05e4798e74dfa8b02b1160ab37d1ad46d9047d/header.jpg?t=1788066238", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/932e4beaee43d08141701368834444a4f559ade8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788066238", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575400/932e4beaee43d08141701368834444a4f559ade8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788066238", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, Arm64<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan 